    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald is delighted to present Windsor House, Donaghmore, to the market. This superb family home built c1995 is set on an impressive, c.2.5 acre site and enjoys beautiful views over the surrounding countryside. Presented in excellent condition both inside and out, this property offers a fantastic turnkey opportunity for families seeking space, comfort, and convenience. \n\nThe location is second to none. Situated just a few kilometres from Limerick City and Ballyneety, Windsor House offers a perfect countryside setting while benefiting from immediate access to major road networks, renowned primary and secondary schools, and a wide range of essential amenities. Donaghmore, Roxboro and Knockea National Schools are all within a five-minute drive, while Drombanna is ideally positioned just ten minutes from Ballyneety, Castletroy, and Limerick Golf Club. \n\nThe property has been meticulously maintained by its current owners and is presented in excellent condition throughout, ready for immediate occupation. Finished to a high standard, the home opens into a bright tiled hallway with the stairs positioned directly ahead. The spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area extends the full length of the house and features an extensive range of fitted units, quality tiled flooring, and a bay window that fills the room with natural light. A generous utility room is located off the kitchen and provides convenient access to the rear of the property. \n\nAt the front of the house, the main living room features a bay window and fireplace, creating a bright and welcoming space, while double doors open to the rear of the property. A second reception room provides flexible additional living space and could be used as a family room, playroom, or home office. The ground floor also includes a fully tiled guest bathroom with a shower. \n\nUpstairs, there are four well-appointed bedrooms, all finished with timber flooring, while some also benefit from built-in wardrobes. The main bedroom features an en-suite bathroom and enjoys views over the rear garden. The main family bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with modern sanitary ware. \n\nThe property is accessed through an attractive gated entrance and driveway, there is ample parking for several cars, while the beautifully maintained grounds offer excellent privacy and lovely countryside views. \n\nThe landscaped gardens feature immaculate lawns and an elevated paved patio to the rear, perfect for outdoor dining and entertaining. A large, detached garage offers excellent additional storage or workshop space. \n\nThis is a truly exceptional property that combines country living with convenience. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. \n\n Accommodation: Entrance hall, Kitchen/dining room, family room, living room, guest bathroom, 4 bedrooms, en-suite, bathroom., utility room. \n\nServices: Gated entrance, off-street parking , OFCH"
      },
